#: l10n/sources/cli.scaffold.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "scaffold.canvas-theme-editor.i18n.helpModalBody1"
msgid ""
"Pick a starter template, edit it like you would in the Canvas Rich Content "
"Editor, then click <strong>Copy HTML</strong> and paste the result into a "
"Canvas page (switch to the HTML editor view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted "
"HTML server-side — this preview doesn't attempt to replicate that, so always "
"verify the pasted result in Canvas."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch dempled cychwyn, golygu ef fel pe baech yn y Canvas Rich Content "
"Editor, yna clicio <strong>Copïo HTML</strong> a gludo'r canlyniad i dudalen "
"Canvas (newid i olygydd HTML yn gyntaf). Mae Canvas yn glanhau HTML a gludir "
"ar y gweinydd — nid yw'r rhagolwg hwn yn ceisio efelychu hynny, felly gwirio "
"bob amser y canlyniad a gludir yn Canvas."

#: l10n/sources/cli.scaffold.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "scaffold.canvas-theme-editor.i18n.helpModalBody2"
msgid ""
"Use <strong>Edit theme</strong> to change the CDN provider, theme, or mode, "
"and to hand-edit the generated <code>theme.css</code>/<code>theme.js</code> "
"before downloading them."
msgstr ""
"Defnyddiwch <strong>Golygu thema</strong> i newid y darparwr CDN, y thema "
"neu'r modd, ac i olygu'r <code>theme.css</code>/<code>theme.js</code> a "
"gynhyrchir yn llaw cyn eu lawrlwytho."

